      "type": "text",
      "text": {
        "content": "<h2>Spells and Spellcasting</h2>\n<p>Spells are divided into nine levels and into the cleric, druid and magic-user lists. Clerics and druids receive spells through their deity; magic-users learn spells from spellbooks and need read magic to decipher them. A caster can only prepare the number of spells shown by the level table, and a spell is expended when cast.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Class</th><th>Level 1</th><th>Level 2</th><th>Level 3</th><th>Level 4</th><th>Level 5</th><th>Level 6</th><th>Level 7</th><th>Level 8</th><th>Level 9</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Cleric 1</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>Cleric 2</td><td>1</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>Cleric 3</td><td>2</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>Cleric 4</td><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>Cleric 5</td><td>2</td><td>2</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>Cleric 6</td><td>2</td><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>Cleric 7</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td>2</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>Cleric 8</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>Cleric 9</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>Cleric 10</td><td>4</td><td>4</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>Cleric 11</td><td>4</td><td>4</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>Cleric 12</td><td>4</td><td>4</td><td>4</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>Magic-User 1